# Denylist for ingestion/Dockerfile.ci (build context is the repo root):
# keep the heavy directories the Dockerfile never COPYs out of the context —
# .git alone is ~2.9 GB, the UI node_modules ~1.6 GB. Everything the Dockerfile
# COPYs (ingestion/, openmetadata-spec/, openmetadata-airflow-apis/, scripts/)
# stays included.
.git/
**/node_modules/
docker/development/docker-volume/
